://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baalbek_Stones]; The Trilithon blocks are Roman work [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baalbek_Stones]; Each Trilithon block is 19 metres long [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baalbek_Stones]; Each Trilithon block weighs around 750–800 tonnes [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baalbek_Stones]; The stones show a gigantism unparalleled in antiquity [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baalbek_Stones]"}]'::jsonb),
