ains its original mosaic floors [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kings_Weston_Roman_Villa]; The villa retains a hypocaust [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kings_Weston_Roman_Villa]; It has the only Roman bath suite visible in Bristol (superlative) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kings_Weston_Roman_Villa]"}]'::jsonb),
