ale were built around the mid-4th century BC [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimale]; The town later gained stoas, a temple and a theater [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimale]; Tiles stamped DIMALLITAN identified the site as Dimale [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimale]; The stoas, temple and theater came in the 3rd and 2nd centuries BC, later than the first walls [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimale]"}]'::jsonb),
